sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as User Browser
  participant Server as Django Web Server
  participant LangChain as Langchain Agent
  participant Ollama as Ollama Server (hosting A.I Model)

  Browser->>Server: POST /stream/start (user prompt)
  Server->>LangChain: get_agent(prompt).bind_tools(agent, tool_list)
  LangChain->>Ollama: API request: user prompt
  Ollama->>Ollama: model interpretation of user prompt
  alt Tool needed
    Ollama-->>LangChain: RUN: tool_name, ARGS: tool_args0
    LangChain-->>LangChain: call tool (e.g., ls_directory(root="/"))
    LangChain-->>Ollama: tool result
  end
  Ollama->>Ollama: model interpretation tool call
  Ollama->>LangChain: model response (answer)
  LangChain->>Server: model response (answer)
  Server->>Browser: Stream response (SSE/WebSocket)
